<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Confirmar e-mail · CETSADP</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;background:#f4f6f8;color:#102d43;font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><main style="max-width:440px;margin:10vh auto;padding:32px;background:#fff;border-top:5px solid #b98632;border-radius:12px"><p style="color:#946424;letter-spacing:3px">CETSADP</p><h1>Confirmar meu e-mail</h1><p>Confirme que este endereço de e-mail pertence a você. Depois, entre no Portal do Aluno com sua matrícula e senha.</p><form method="post" action="{{ request()->fullUrl() }}">@csrf<input id="email-token" type="hidden" name="token"><button id="email-confirmar" type="submit" disabled style="padding:14px 24px;background:#09253e;color:#fff;border:0;border-radius:8px;font-size:16px">Confirmar e-mail</button></form><p id="email-aviso" role="status">Abra o link completo recebido em seu e-mail para continuar.</p><noscript>Ative o JavaScript para usar o link individual de confirmação.</noscript></main><script>(() => { const token = new URLSearchParams(location.hash.slice(1)).get('token') || ''; history.replaceState(null, '', location.pathname + location.search); if (/^[a-f0-9]{64}$/.test(token)) { document.getElementById('email-token').value = token; document.getElementById('email-confirmar').disabled = false; document.getElementById('email-aviso').textContent = 'O endereço será confirmado somente ao clicar no botão acima.'; } })();</script></body></html>
